              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.26.55"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "26:55",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.33.54"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33:54",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.17.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 17:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.17.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " wakasema, BWANA alimwagiza bwana wangu awape wana wa Israeli nchi kwa kupiga kura iwe urithi wao; tena bwana wangu aliagizwa na BWANA awape binti za Selofehadi ndugu yetu huo urithi wa baba yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakiolewa na watu wa wana wa hayo makabila mengine ya wana wa Israeli, ndipo urithi wao utatwaliwa na kuondolewa katika urithi wa baba zetu, na hilo kabila watakalotiwa ndani yake litaongezewa urithi wao; basi urithi huo utaondolewa katika kura ya urithi wetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.25.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Law 25:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Tena itakapokuwapo hiyo jubilii ya wana wa Israeli, ndipo urithi wa hilo kabila ambalo wamekuwa ndani yake utaongezewa huo urithi wao; hivyo urithi wao utaondolewa katika urithi wa kabila la baba zetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hes 27:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Basi Musa akawaagiza wana wa Israeli kama neno la BWANA lilivyokuwa, akasema, Kabila la wana wa Yusufu imenena yaliyo haki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "BWANA ameagiza neno hili katika habari ya binti za Selofehadi, akasema, Na waolewe na waume wawapendao; lakini na waolewe katika jamaa ya kabila la baba zao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.21.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Fal 21:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hivyo hapana urithi wowote wa wana wa Israeli utakaotoka kabila hili kwenda kabila hili; kwa kuwa wana wa Israeli watashikamana kila mtu na urithi wa kabila la baba zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.23.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Nya 23:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Na kila binti atakayemiliki urithi katika kabila lolote katika wana wa Israeli, ataolewa katika jamaa moja ya kabila la baba yake, ili wana wa Israeli wapate kumiliki kila mtu urithi wa baba zake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo hapatakuwa na urithi wowote utakaotoka kabila hili kwenda kabila hili; kwa kuwa makabila ya wana wa Israeli yatashikamana kila mmoja na urithi wake mwenyewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi hao binti za Selofehadi wakafanya kama BWANA alivyomwagiza Musa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.27.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hes 27:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kwa kuwa Mala, na Tirza, na Hogla, na Milka, na Nuhu, binti za Selofehadi waliolewa na wanaume, wana wa ndugu za baba yao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waliolewa katika jamaa za wana wa Manase, mwana wa Yusufu, na urithi wao ukakaa katika kabila la jamaa ya baba yao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.36.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
